      "text": "We start by distributing.\n$(2x)(x) + (2x)(7) - (5)(x) - (5)(7) - (x)(2x) - (x)(1) - (5)(2x) - (5)(-1)$.\nCanceling variables and constants with similar degrees to the expression\n$2x^2 + 14x - 5x - 35 - 2x^2 - x - 10x + 5$.\n\nCombine like terms.\n$(2x^2 - 2x^2) + (14x - 5x - x - 10x) - 35 + 5$.\nSimplifying, we get $(2 - 2 - 5 + 1) + (14x - 16x) = -4 - 2x$.\n$\\boxed{-2x - 4}$\nEnd solution.",
